01-f5105e2f-0a5e-4db7-b300-ebf93c23b589"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"ae724eb8b019a6e1fe72e0a678ae477507b2f71ae0bbd8d979e2ffcbabdadfb7","event_uuid":"5d35f396-6ed2-4e26-880c-b8e27be0d7bc","position":{"commit_sha":"6bca3edd824e9158dba33ec3e98e81328cfe6da5","position":"1785618485604568001-5d35f396-6ed2-4e26-880c-b8e27be0d7bc"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1785372549282668001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"Bring `resolve_event_commit` and `resolve_position_commit` in line with the bulk map builders,\nwhich already carry both flags. This is an authorship-correctness fix, unrelated to repo size. session_log **1cb6-d553-6565-49b4** (measured facts; do not re-derive).\n\n## Why\n`authorship.py:152-168` (`resolve_event_commit`) and `:194-209` (`resolve_position_commit`) omit\n`--no-renames` and `-c log.showSignature=false`; the bulk builders at `:313-331` and `:383-401` carry\nboth, and `:298-300` documents why. The missing `log.showSignature=false` is a **live latent bug**:\non a host with `log.showSignature=true`, `gpg:` lines interleave into stdout and `lines[-1]`\n(`:172`, `:213`) returns a non-SHA.\n\n`--no-renames` is behaviour-preserving: it can only convert `R` into `A`+`D`; both pathspecs match at\nmost one path (positions are globally unique `{ts}-{uuid}`); and the only event-file renames are\n`.json` -> `.json.retired`, which no `*.json` pathspec matches. **Do not add `--no-merges`** —\n`authorship.py:294` documents that the fallback exists precisely to catch files added only inside\nmerge commits.\n\nNote: an earlier framing justified this as a partial-clone performance fix. That motivation is\n**not** established — pathspec limiting runs before diffcore rename detection, so these single-path\nresolvers likely never fault blobs. The correctness argument stands on its own.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] With `log.showSignature=true` **and signed commits** in the fixture repo (a `gpg.program` /\n      `gpg.format` shim suffices), both resolvers return a valid **40-hex SHA**. Tier: **unit**\n      against a real temporary git repo. The signing is load-bearing: with `--format=%H` over\n      *unsigned* commits the setting emits no extra lines, so an unsigned fixture makes this\n      **vacuously green**.\n- [ ] Both flags appear in the argv of both resolvers, and `--no-merges` does **not**. Tier: **unit**\n      pinning the constructed command.\n- [ ] Resolver output matches the bulk map builders' output over a sample of >=100 real events — the\n      cross-check that the flags did not change semantics. Tier: **integration** against the store.\n\n## Files\n`src/rebar/attest/authorship.py`, tests\n\nScope: XS-S. No dependencies.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/attest/authorship.py","reason":"both resolvers get the two flags"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","42eb-5789-c798-4dfc"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"42eb-5789-c798-4dfc","parent_status_uuid":"f5105e2f-0a5e-4db7-b300-ebf93c23b589","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"e6c1-ff43-5e6c-4067","ticket_type":"story","title":"B5: add --no-renames and -c log.showSignature=false to the two authorship resolvers","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["62b67cc1-23a8-4c42-8373-f1250dc97d22","3807cdd9-b3b1-4ab0-9043-782e6debf620","d52a00cb-75d1-467a-9690-332845cc431d","38a25fa7-e309-471e-b0e0-19059b2ac9fb","f5105e2f-0a5e-4db7-b300-ebf93c23b589","5d35f396-6ed2-4e26-880c-b8e27be0d7bc"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785618485604568002,"uuid":"11a355fb-34cf-4233-9674-845816fb9ace"}